---

<section id="hero" class="relative isolate bg-[#1A1A1A] py-20 lg:py-28 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background Image with Dark Gradient Scrim -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
    <img
      src="/assets/media/9b4bff48c59524eb63094d56c988364a-1536.webp"
      alt="Utah Tax Attorneys"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
      loading="eager"
      fetchpriority="high" />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/70 via-black/60 to-black/75"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto px-4 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center">
    <h1 class="text-[40px] font-bold text-white font-serif leading-[1.1] mb-5">
      Utah Tax Attorneys
    </h1>
    <p class="text-[18px] sm:text-[20px] lg:text-[22px] text-gray-200 italic max-w-[860px] mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      We fight the IRS to achieve the best possible outcome for you. Don't deal with the IRS alone — contact us for a consultation and find out why our clients recommend us.
    </p>

    <!-- 3 Testimonial Glass Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 w-full text-left">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 rounded-[8px] p-6 text-white shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[#f59e0b] text-[16px] tracking-wider mb-3 select-none" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-100 italic m-0">
            "Very prompt and responsive to all questions raised. Skilled and thorough tax attorneys!"
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-gray-300 font-medium mt-4 mb-0">
          — Adrienne Prude
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 rounded-[8px] p-6 text-white shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[#f59e0b] text-[16px] tracking-wider mb-3 select-none" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-100 italic m-0">
            "Amazing firm. The entire team works hard to answer all my questions and get my problems resolved as quickly as possible."
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-gray-300 font-medium mt-4 mb-0">
          — Joanna Smith
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-md border border-white/15 rounded-[8px] p-6 text-white shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <div class="text-[#f59e0b] text-[16px] tracking-wider mb-3 select-none" aria-label="5 stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-gray-100 italic m-0">
            "I searched the web for tax attorneys who were familiar with the new opportunity zone tax benefits. The attorneys at Michelle Turpin P.C. were the only ones I could find who were knowledgeable in this area."
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[14px] text-gray-300 font-medium mt-4 mb-0">
          — Johnnie Sasaki
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
